(test 1)
(name "an-object-switching-over-a-value-of-an-enum-runs-the-arm-of-its-case")
(note "The object a build writes for a switch binding `host` and `port` of `remote`, read and run. The run matches the value's spelling against the enum's name and the arm's case, binds the fields to their slots and returns `port`.")
